  "prompt": "In the neon-lit night of this cyberpunk metropolis, only the gleaming, razor-sharp claw tips of a colossal mechanical panther pierce the frame, tearing through the sky. In the extreme foreground, a young woman trips and falls during her frantic escape. She is so close to the lens that every detail of her grime-streaked face, contorted in terror and despair, is visible as she struggles to push herself up with one arm. The mid-ground is filled with the silhouettes of a panicked crowd fleeing, their forms starkly outlined by the blazing explosions behind them. In the background, skyscrapers crumble and collapse, while tracer rounds streak across the smoke-choked night sky. Thick dust and raging flames intertwine, devouring the remnants of steel and concrete. Captured from a dramatic low-angle shot, the scene is overwhelming with a sense of apocalyptic devastation. --ar 9:16",
